{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12406","headline":"夜宿灵台寺寄郎士元 · 钱起","name":"夜宿灵台寺寄郎士元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西日横山含碧空，东方吐月满禅宫。\n朝瞻双顶青冥上，夜宿诸天色界中。\n石潭倒献莲花水，塔院空闻松柏风。\n万里故人能尚尔，知君视听我心同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}